INN++ (the inn2-cxx package) is a C++20/CMake conversion of INN 2.8.0.
Source: https://github.com/ecarew/inn2

This file is support/mkdeb's assembly of INN++'s LICENSE, below, which
lists the files under licenses other than INN's own, following the form
of Debian's inn2 package (debian/copyright, maintained by Marco d'Itri).
Files added by INN++ are under INN's license at the top of LICENSE.

On Debian systems, the complete text of the GNU General Public License
version 2 can be found in `/usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-2'.

The Debian packaging (packaging/debian/) is under the same license as
INN.

----------------------------------------------------------------------

